<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Rapport des Réservations - PiDev Voyage</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'DejaVu Sans', 'Helvetica', Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #f5f1e8;
            padding: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        
        .report-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        
        .report-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #93032E 0%, #C49A6C 50%, #6B0221 100%);
            padding: 40px;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
        }
        
        .logo-section {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .logo-icon {
            width: 70px;
            height: 70px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 35px;
            border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
        }
        
        .company-info h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            margin: 0;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        
        .company-info p {
            font-size: 12px;
            opacity: 0.9;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }
        
        .report-subtitle h2 {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin: 20px 0 10px;
        }
        
        .report-subtitle p {
            font-size: 11px;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }
        
        .stats-section {
            padding: 30px;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFFFFF 0%, #FEF9F0 100%);
        }
        
        .stats-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
        }
        
        .stat-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border: 1px solid #e8e6e1;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }
        
        .stat-card::before {
            content: '';
            display: block;
            height: 3px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #93032E, #C49A6C);
            width: 100%;
            margin-top: -20px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0;
        }
        
        .stat-icon {
            font-size: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        
        .stat-number {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #93032E;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        
        .stat-label {
            font-size: 10px;
            color: #7f8c8d;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        
        .summary-section {
            padding: 30px;
            background: white;
            border-top: 1px solid #e8e6e1;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e6e1;
        }
        
        .summary-title {
            color: #93032E;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .summary-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 15px;
        }
        
        .summary-item {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 12px 15px;
            background: #FEF9F0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border-left: 3px solid #93032E;
        }
        
        .summary-item-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #2c3e50;
            font-size: 11px;
        }
        
        .summary-item-value {
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #93032E;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        
        .table-section {
            padding: 30px;
            background: white;
        }
        
        .section-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            padding-bottom: 15px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #93032E;
        }
        
        .section-header h3 {
            color: #93032E;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0;
        }
        
        .record-count {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #93032E, #C49A6C);
            color: white;
            padding: 5px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        
        .table-wrapper {
            overflow-x: auto;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #e8e6e1;
        }
        
        .reservations-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 10px;
        }
        
        .reservations-table th {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #93032E, #7a0220);
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 8px;
            text-align: left;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        
        .reservations-table td {
            padding: 8px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
        }
        
        .reservations-table tr:nth-child(even) {
            background: #f9f8f6;
        }
        
        .price-cell {
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #93032E;
        }
        
        .badge-paid {
            background: #D1F4E9;
            color: #047857;
            padding: 3px 10px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 9px;
            font-weight: 700;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        
        .badge-pending {
            background: #FEF3DC;
            color: #92400E;
            padding: 3px 10px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 9px;
            font-weight: 700;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        
        .report-footer {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #93032E, #6B0221);
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
        }
        
        .footer-line {
            width: 50px;
            height: 2px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
            margin: 15px auto;
        }
        
        .footer-signature {
            margin-top: 15px;
            padding-top: 15px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            font-size: 10px;
            font-style: italic;
        }
        
        @media print {
            body { background: white; padding: 0; }
            .report-container { box-shadow: none; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="report-container">
        
        <div class="report-header">
            <div class="logo-section">
                <div class="logo-icon">✈️</div>
                <div class="company-info">
                    <h1>PiDev Voyage</h1>
                    <p>Excellence en Voyages & Réservations</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="report-subtitle">
                <h2>📊 Rapport Complet des Réservations</h2>
                <p>Généré le {{ "now"|date("d/m/Y \\à H:i:s") }}</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="stats-section">
            <div class="stats-grid">
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-icon">📋</div>
                    <div class="stat-number">{{ reservations|length }}</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">Réservations</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-icon">✅</div>
                    <div class="stat-number">{{ reservations|filter(r => r.statutPaiement == 'payé')|length }}</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">Confirmées</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-icon">⏳</div>
                    <div class="stat-number">{{ reservations|filter(r => r.statutPaiement == 'en attente')|length }}</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">En attente</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-icon">💰</div>
                    <div class="stat-number">{{ (reservations|sum(attribute='prixProg'))|number_format(0) }}</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">CA Total (DT)</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="summary-section">
            <div class="summary-title">📈 Résumé Financier</div>
            <div class="summary-grid">
                <div class="summary-item">
                    <span class="summary-item-label">Montant moyen / réservation</span>
                    <span class="summary-item-value">
                        {% if reservations|length > 0 %}
                            {{ (reservations|sum(attribute='prixProg') / reservations|length)|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} DT
                        {% else %}0.00 DT{% endif %}
                    </span>
                </div>
                <div class="summary-item">
                    <span class="summary-item-label">Taux de paiement</span>
                    <span class="summary-item-value">
                        {% if reservations|length > 0 %}
                            {{ ((reservations|filter(r => r.statutPaiement == 'payé')|length / reservations|length) * 100)|number_format(1) }}%
                        {% else %}0%{% endif %}
                    </span>
                </div>
                <div class="summary-item">
                    <span class="summary-item-label">Total voyageurs</span>
                    <span class="summary-item-value">{{ reservations|sum(attribute='nbre') }} pers</span>
                </div>
                <div class="summary-item">
                    <span class="summary-item-label">Documents</span>
                    <span class="summary-item-value">{{ reservations|length }} factures</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="table-section">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h3>📋 Détail des réservations</h3>
                <span class="record-count">{{ reservations|length }} enregistrement(s)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="table-wrapper">
                <table class="reservations-table">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>ID</th>
                            <th>Programme</th>
                            <th>Voyage</th>
                            <th>Client</th>
                            <th>Email</th>
                            <th>Téléphone</th>
                            <th>Pers.</th>
                            <th>Montant</th>
                            <th>Date</th>
                            <th>Statut</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        {% for r in reservations %}
                        <tr>
                            <td>#{{ r.idRP }}</td>
                            <td>{{ r.programme_nom|default('-')|slice(0, 20) }}</td>
                            <td>{{ r.voyage_nom|default('-')|slice(0, 15) }}</td>
                            <td><strong>{{ r.prenom }} {{ r.nom }}</strong></td>
                            <td>{{ r.email|default('-')|slice(0, 25) }}</td>
                            <td>{{ r.telephone|default('-') }}</td>
                            <td style="text-align: center;">{{ r.nbre }}</td>
                            <td class="price-cell">{{ r.prixProg|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} DT</td>
                            <td>{{ r.dateProgramme ? r.dateProgramme|date('d/m/Y') : '-' }}</td>
                            <td>
                                {% if r.statutPaiement == 'payé' %}
                                    <span class="badge-paid">✓ Payé</span>
                                {% else %}
                                    <span class="badge-pending">⏳ Attente</span>
                                {% endif %}
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="report-footer">
            <p style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;">✨ Merci de votre confiance ✨</p>
            <div class="footer-line"></div>
            <p>PiDev Voyage - Plateforme de Gestion des Réservations</p>
            <p style="opacity: 0.75;">Document généré automatiquement - Confidentiel</p>
            <div class="footer-signature">
                🌍 Excellence en tourisme • 100% Satisfaction Client
            </div>
        </div>
        
    </div>
</body>
</html>